 name against the day's\\nexpected-visitor list.\"},{\"text\":\"Visitor badges are printed from the front desk terminal.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"Print a badge from the front desk terminal.\"},{\"text\":\"The host's name is written on the visitor badge in the space provided.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"Write the\\nhost's name on the badge in the space provided.\"},{\"text\":\"The visitor is asked to wear the badge above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"Hand the badge over and ask the\\nvisitor to wear it above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\"},{\"text\":\"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\"},{\"text\":\"Returned badges are wiped with the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Wipe the badge with\\nthe cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\"},{\"text\":\"The cleaning cloth is kept in the top drawer.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Wipe the badge with\\nthe cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\"},{\"text\":\"Returned badges are put back in the return tray.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Wipe the badge with\\nthe cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\"},{\"text\":\"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\"},{\"text\":\"If a badge is not returned, the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list is marked with an N.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N.\"},{\"text\":\"At the end of the day, the list of unreturned badges is sent to the security office.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"At the end of\\nthe day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office.\"},{\"text\":\"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"Badges that\\nhave been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\"},{\"text\":\"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office rather than back into the return tray.\",\"line\":23,\"span\":\"A badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office\\nrather than back into the return tray.\"},{\"text\":\"The security office decides whether to reactivate a badge handed in after it was reported missing.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"The security office decides whether to\\nreactivate it.\"},{\"text\":\"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead of a day badge.\",\"line\":29,\"span\":\"Contractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead\\nof a day badge.\"},{\"text\":\"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\",\"line\":30,\"span\":\"A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it.\"},{\"text\":\"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\",\"line\":30,\"span\":\"Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\"}]}","ttft_ms":8784,"type":"result","duration_ms":8822,"uuid":"602a5ec6-897b-41ef-b0cd-77b43c870a25","ttft_stream_ms":1513,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":1514,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
